cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol or the numbers it produces, cite it. Include the exact protocol and software versions — a number without them is not reproducible."
title: "UpliftBench: a placebo-corrected benchmark for Agent Skills"
abstract: >-
  A three-arm measurement protocol (no skill / token-matched placebo / real skill) for agent skill
  packages, plus a CLI that produces SkillCards, badges and a static leaderboard. The placebo arm
  separates "a longer context helps" from "this skill's knowledge helps"; uplift is defined as
  treatment minus placebo, never treatment minus baseline.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "UpliftBench contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/25Cloud/UpliftBench"
url: "https://github.com/25Cloud/UpliftBench"
version: "0.2.7"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
keywords:
  - agent-skills
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - placebo
  - llm-agents
  - reproducibility
references:
